E4b prototype for fuddlesworth/pokebw2 at 41f42ca1afe6291f00b0ba0ec3f6099b9ff1346c: let the map model and map texture
packers append entries that start from an existing ("template") entry. Modifies GPL-3.0 code, so this patch is
GPL-3.0. Recorded for Phase 1 and a possible upstream pull request (docs/research/e4b-map-art.md); no build applies it.
Check: git apply --check docs/research/e4b-template-append.patch (in a pokebw2 checkout at the commit above).

